# Temple Grounds 0e_temple_hive_hall layer 0: CIngBlobSwarm u044e, u0445. For tools/cov/specs/swarmbasics.py: god-mode player stands in swarm u044e, lets
# the boids touch it, shoots every beam/charge/missile at it, boosts through it in morph ball, then
# drives the swarm's script messages (Increment/Decrement, InternalMessage0 x12 and boost kills for
# the >10 death-message queue, Deactivate/Activate, Delete at the end).
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give missile 250; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give annihilatorBeam 1; give screwAttack 1; fastmorph 1
@f380 send u044e Activate; send u0445 Activate
@f400 obj u044e
@f420 tp 90.3 -353.4 -96.0
@f700 obj u044e
@f720 lockon 1
@f740 shoot u044e
@f770 shoot u044e charged
@f800 shoot u044e missile
@f830 beam dark
@f840 shoot u044e; shoot u0445
@f870 shoot u044e charged
@f900 beam light
@f910 shoot u044e
@f940 shoot u044e charged
@f980 beam annihilator
@f990 shoot u044e; shoot u0445 charged
@f1030 beam power
@f1040 noise 6
@f1060 tp 90.3 -353.4 -96.0
@f1080 press x 30
@f1200 boost
@f1260 boost
@f1320 damage u044e 5 0 boostball
@f1340 damage u044e 50 0 cannonball
@f1380 press x 30
@f1450 send u044e Decrement
@f1500 send u044e Increment
@f1520 send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0
@f1600 send u044e Deactivate
@f1640 send u044e Activate
@f1700 obj u044e
@f1720 send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0; send u044e InternalMessage0
@f1740 tp 90.3 -353.4 -96.0
@f1760 press x 30
@f1840 boost
@f1880 tp 90.3 -353.4 -96.0
@f1900 boost
@f1940 tp 90.3 -353.4 -96.0
@f1960 boost
@f2000 tp 90.3 -353.4 -96.0
